    "steps": [
      "Start pinned Blender 4.0.2 with --background --factory-startup.",
      "Compose six original EN-08 prop arrangements with explicit positions, yaw and scale; use no random source.",
      "Reject buried, floating, overlapping or trail-intruding component bounds before joining each cluster.",
      "Generate bounded UV0, apply identity transforms and export one self-contained glTF 2.0 GLB with no camera, light, animation or collision authority.",
